="lucide lucide-star h-4 w-4 text-yellow-400 fill-yellow-400"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-gray-600 line-clamp-4">Excellent service from start to finish! The movers were professional, punctual, and handled all my belongings with care. The move was completed faster than expected, and nothing was damaged. Highly recommend Berlin Movers for anyone moving within Germany.</p></div><div class="bg-background rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex items-center mb-4"><div class="relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden mr-4"><img alt="Sophie Müller" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/placeholder.svg?height=200&amp;width=200"/></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Sophie Müller</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Hamburg Umzug Express</p></div></div><div class="flex mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star h-4 w-4 text-yellow-400 fill-yellow-400"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.1